  "discussion": {
    "headline": "Not as stormy this week with a pleasant weekend to follow",
    "dateLine": "12:15 p.m. Tuesday, August 11, 2026",
    "excerpt": "Following a partly-to-mostly sunny, hot and humid end to the weekend, more showers and thunderstorms rumbled through northern MD, southeastern PA and the Lower Susquehanna Valley on Monday. One round impacted south-central PA during the morning with the second right on its heels between 1-6 PM. Along with locally heavy rainfall and frequent lightning, the storms caused numerous downed trees and powerlines, as well as nickel- to quarter-sized hail, in parts of the region. …",
